<title>USA: CBOE to trade options on Data Dimensions on Monday.</title>
<headline>CBOE to trade options on Data Dimensions on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange (CBOE) will trade options on Data Dimensions Inc on Monday, March 31, the exchange said.</p>
<p>Data Dimensions, located in Bellevue, Wash., is a consulting company that deals with year 2000 computer problems.</p>
<p>Options on Data Dimensions will trade on the February cycle, with initial strike prices at 17-1/2, 20 and 22-1/2. ((Derivatives desk 312-408-8750))E-mail derivatives@reuters.com</p>
</text>
